      "cooked": "<p>That feeling when the Christopher will not eat the bread.</p>\n<p>Ah, and now I understand the nature of the universe: Christopher has limited time! What a sucky universe. :C</p>\n<p>Oh man, that quiz show music. XD Trevor's done it again! I was walking on a treadmill and rocking the heck out every time Paul got an answer right.</p>\n<p>Now that Christopher has 'shown off' his collection of canes, my question is: Is he familiar/capable with the cane self-defense martial arts?</p>",
