      "cooked": "<p>nice.<br>\nwhen i did my my research for my Shadowrun Face/Adept i could not find a free reprint of that old article</p>\n<p>back to the episode they were talking about pod cast recommendations Daren Watts from the History of Sentinels writing team has one</p>\n<aside class=\"onebox allowlistedgeneric\">\n  <header class=\"source\">\n      <a href=\"https://explainthis.podbean.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">explainthis.podbean.com</a>\n  </header>\n  <article class=\"onebox-body\">\n    <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/f/f8117bb7b0f4d7adeb1625612d2428c990cea611_2_500x500.png\" class=\"thumbnail onebox-avatar\" width=\"500\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/f/f8117bb7b0f4d7adeb1625612d2428c990cea611_2_500x500.png, //forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/f/f8117bb7b0f4d7adeb1625612d2428c990cea611_2_750x750.png 1.5x, //forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/f/f8117bb7b0f4d7adeb1625612d2428c990cea611_2_1000x1000.png 2x\" data-small-upload=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/f/f8117bb7b0f4d7adeb1625612d2428c990cea611_2_10x10.png\">\n\n<h3><a href=\"https://explainthis.podbean.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Explain This Comics Guys</a></h3>\n\n<p>The Comics Guys explain the history behind the comics industry...</p>\n\n\n  </article>\n  <div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n    \n    \n  </div>\n  <div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n</aside>\n",
