      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/jeysie/{size}/1868_2.png",
      "created_at": "2020-10-31T00:47:12.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Can I just say how I appreciate that Paul has embraced the \"making things up\" mantle with flying colors? The bit where he was asked about the various Sentinels corporations was great.</p>\n<p>Also WalkingTarget grabbed some piccies of Christopher's canes to add to&nbsp;his summary notes:&nbsp;https://imgur.com/a/qGBGGlN</p>\n<p>(The context is that earlier that day in the Letters Page chat Christopher was making a joking old man rant about kids these days, someone joke asked if he needed a stick to wave at those kids, I said my old woman self is envious because I bet that Christopher actually has a fancy cane to shake and he confirmed he did and he'd show them if I asked. Which of course I did because heck yes I want to see fancy canes.)</p>",
